# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, The Fallen Fane — Part Two: The Fallen Fane (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** The Fallen Fane (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Part Two (pp. 9–14)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Part Two, verbatim: the players’ briefing -- Ars Magica, the Order of Hermes and its Code, Tribunals,
> the fall of Fanum and the covenants.
> Records: the characters and covenants in `…-the-fallen-fane-*.actor` (the characters in `…-characters-*`, the covenants in `…-the-fallen-fane-covenant-*`); the Character Priority table in `…-introduction-tables.ttrpg`.

